The system also includes a fallback mechanism for failed log fetches using a multi-tier dynamic load balancer that redistributes workloads based on server health, resource availability, geographic proximity, and application-defined priorities. This ensures that the system can scale horizontally to accommodate increasing client loads and log volume without performance degradation.

