The `FinancialRNG` namespace contains the `MTGenerator` class, which encapsulates all functionality for generating random numbers. The constructor accepts a unique seed, ensuring no two instances share the same seed unless explicitly requested. The `getRandomNumber()` method returns a uniformly distributed 64-bit integer using the `std::mt19937` and `std::uniform_int_distribution` classes.

