The RESTful API for integrating with other systems is well-documented and easy to use, providing clear guidelines for error handling and response formats to enhance user experience. Implementations of secure authentication and authorization mechanisms are used to protect sensitive data, ensuring that encryption is used for data in transit and at rest where necessary.']

