The `reduce` function implements an asynchronous reduction operation with backpressure support, allowing the system to efficiently manage multiple simultaneous requests and handle partial results gracefully. The custom memory pool used by the `loadResourceBundle` function helps prevent fragmentation and OOM errors during high concurrency.

