3. Initializes the secure logging system using the encryption algorithm defined in `ENCRYPTION_ALGORITHM`.
4. Loops through each dependency in the build environment and checks if it is available and can be resolved. If a dependency is not found, an error message is logged and the function returns.
5. Logs the resolution of each dependency using the secure logging system.
6. Sets the end time as the build time.
7. Calculates the build time and size using the `get_build_size` function.
8. Logs the end of the build process using the secure logging system.
