The `networkThread` thread handles incoming sensor data using the `readSensorData()` function, which reads the data from a file stream. In case of network errors, the function retries with exponential backoff using a `try-catch` block. The `loadBalancingThread` thread simply handles incoming sensor data by adding it to the buffer and notifying all waiting threads.

