To ensure high-throughput performance, the code uses zero-copy techniques to minimize CPU overhead while reducing memory fragmentation. The `LTE_DL_CCCH_MESSAGE` structure is designed to be memory-efficient, with an efficient use of pointers and minimal data duplication.

